    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85247" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύπους</span></b>  (B) (first in <i><span class="en">
			Arist.
		</span></i>), later Gr. for <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πουλύ-</span></b> ,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
		ὁ</span>:— Declension: nom. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
